WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.050 --> 00:01:48.020
Someone once said:

00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:51.390
There are watermelons with fruit flesh

00:01:51.390 --> 00:01:54.260
from which spurts super sweet soda-water...

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:57.530
Sodawatermelons!

00:01:58.660 --> 00:02:03.730
Raw oysters who beget berries with 
an extremely high sugar content,

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:06.300
and a rich, deep flavor 
of dried persimmons...

00:02:06.300 --> 00:02:09.370
Raw Oystersimmons!

00:02:10.100 --> 00:02:13.070
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:13.070 --> 00:02:17.340
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:20.980
For Terry, who was refusing to eat,

00:02:20.980 --> 00:02:25.350
Toriko headed with Terry to the 
Wu Jungle to capture BB Corn,

00:02:25.350 --> 00:02:27.090
an ingredient from the Gourmet world.

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:31.890
At the same time, in order to 
capture the Woolstar Sauce fruit,

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:34.290
Komatsu and Tina chased after Toriko.

00:02:35.230 --> 00:02:38.360
The Zombie Wood stood in 
Toriko and Terry's way,

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:40.600
and Terry had a tough time 
against its ferocious power.

00:02:40.600 --> 00:02:44.370
But, showing a portion of his talent 
at battle, Terry was victorious!

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:51.680
For Terry's Sake! Burst 
By Broiling Heat, BB Corn!

00:02:57.380 --> 00:03:00.490
How many hundreds of 
meters tall is this tree?

00:03:00.490 --> 00:03:05.190
Plus, these countless branches 
can handle my weight with ease.

00:03:05.890 --> 00:03:10.630
With this, it wouldn't be a problem to 
build a high rise on top of the forest.

00:03:10.860 --> 00:03:15.330
But if I think of it as a giant thing 
to eat instead of a building...

00:03:15.330 --> 00:03:18.740
I can't contain myself! 
I'm watering at the mouth!

00:03:20.510 --> 00:03:23.040
Oh, Terry! Is that the top?

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:25.140
Here I come!

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:39.820
Terry, we've hit the jackpot!

00:03:39.820 --> 00:03:42.130
BB Corn has been sighted!

00:03:43.330 --> 00:03:48.400
Wow! I've never seen so many 
splendid cobs of corn like this...

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:52.570
How much should I bring 
back as a present for Tom?

00:03:55.670 --> 00:03:57.980
It's incredibly thick and springy.

00:03:57.980 --> 00:03:59.680
The cob is really stuck on tight!

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:06.780
What?

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:08.020
It's not even budging?

00:04:08.990 --> 00:04:13.360
It's so heavy, it's like I'm trying 
to pick up the entire forest!

00:04:14.790 --> 00:04:18.260
It must be connected to every 
plant here in the Wu Jungle.

00:04:18.260 --> 00:04:22.800
Does the BB Corn suck up nutrients 
from the entire forest to grow?

00:04:24.170 --> 00:04:25.700
Fine, in that case...

00:04:25.700 --> 00:04:27.040
Knife!

00:04:28.740 --> 00:04:30.170
What?!

00:04:30.170 --> 00:04:31.070
Okay!

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:33.280
Knife-knife-knife-knife-knife-knife-knife!

00:04:33.280 --> 00:04:34.640
Knife!

00:04:36.410 --> 00:04:40.520
Its fibers are so complexly wound 
together, it's extremely strong!

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:43.250
That was like a GT Robot's arm!

00:04:44.850 --> 00:04:46.320
What's wrong, Terry?

00:04:51.490 --> 00:04:54.230
W-What the...

00:04:54.230 --> 00:04:57.300
It really is like a building standing there!

00:04:57.500 --> 00:05:01.800
The chef who has departed to the 
danger zone of the Wu Jungle

00:05:01.800 --> 00:05:04.940
in order to get ingredients for the Gourmet 
Summit has currently gone missing.

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:05.670
Komatsu-kun...

00:05:05.670 --> 00:05:10.240
However, the Gourmet Summit 
is proceeding as planned...

00:05:05.840 --> 00:05:07.640
Now, it is my turn!

00:05:07.640 --> 00:05:12.110
I have waited this long, so 
please make it worth my while.

00:05:12.110 --> 00:05:13.610
Are you even listening?

00:05:13.610 --> 00:05:16.680
Ah, pardon the sudden interruption, but 
we've just received new information!

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:19.890
It seems like one of the dishes 
at the summit's dinner banquet

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:22.920
is set to be Bubbly Tuna from a Mermaituna!

00:05:22.920 --> 00:05:26.260
Mermaituna is an extremely rare ingredient

00:05:23.360 --> 00:05:25.060
Um, Coco-san?

00:05:25.060 --> 00:05:27.460
The rare Mermaituna, yes?

00:05:26.260 --> 00:05:30.530
that only the absolute best 
Gourmet Hunters can obtain...

00:05:27.560 --> 00:05:31.130
If the chef doesn't return 
by the expiration date,

00:05:31.130 --> 00:05:34.070
he'll be needing a replacement Mermaituna.

00:05:34.070 --> 00:05:37.500
Ah, we can earn a bundle 
at once from the IGO.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:41.070
Coco-san, divine the perfect fishing 
spot for catching a Mermaituna!

00:05:41.540 --> 00:05:43.380
Today's fortune telling is over.

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:48.010
What'll we do?

00:05:48.010 --> 00:05:49.380
Should we try going inside?

00:05:49.380 --> 00:05:52.220
Hey... This forest is seriously dangerous.

00:05:52.220 --> 00:05:56.090
Well, I managed to have grand adventures 
in it without much trouble, of course.

00:05:56.090 --> 00:05:58.490
Tch, all he did was run around in circles.

00:05:58.490 --> 00:06:00.560
Huh?! You say something?

00:06:00.560 --> 00:06:01.660
Oh, nothing!

00:06:01.060 --> 00:06:01.660
Oh!

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:02.460
What?

00:06:01.830 --> 00:06:03.160
You definitely said something!

00:06:02.460 --> 00:06:03.160
Look!

00:06:03.160 --> 00:06:04.430
Nope! Didn't say a thing!

00:06:04.430 --> 00:06:07.230
This is Cod Roe Wheat!

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:09.340
Spiced cod roe flavored wheat?!

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:10.470
Oh, right.

00:06:10.740 --> 00:06:14.910
I thought we might find some, so I 
brought Parmepepper seeds with me.

00:06:14.910 --> 00:06:18.940
If I combine these seeds 
with the Cod Roe Wheat...

00:06:18.940 --> 00:06:21.380
I might be able to make an interesting spice!

00:06:27.290 --> 00:06:29.550
It's an invigorating fragrance!

00:06:30.260 --> 00:06:32.660
Hmm, let me try it...

00:06:33.230 --> 00:06:34.590
Yum!

00:06:40.130 --> 00:06:41.170
Spicy!

00:06:41.170 --> 00:06:42.400
Zonge-sama!

00:06:42.670 --> 00:06:45.300
Rhey! Rhou rhying rho rhill rhe?!

00:06:45.300 --> 00:06:46.500
I'm sorry!

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:49.310
A failure, huh?

00:06:49.310 --> 00:06:51.040
Spicy!

00:06:52.740 --> 00:06:54.410
Spicy!

00:06:56.810 --> 00:06:59.950
It's even more impressive 
looking at it up close...

00:07:00.450 --> 00:07:03.650
Isn't it like, about 20 stories high?

00:07:03.650 --> 00:07:08.490
And if the number of silks is equal to 
the number of kernels inside the corn...

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:11.090
Just how many kernels are inside?!

00:07:11.090 --> 00:07:12.360
Right, Terry?

00:07:12.800 --> 00:07:14.830
Okay, here I go!

00:07:17.130 --> 00:07:18.700
Knife!

00:07:21.440 --> 00:07:24.370
The leaf is pretty damn thick and hard!

00:07:24.370 --> 00:07:27.040
Terry, rip it off from the inside!

00:07:32.020 --> 00:07:34.250
Okay, one more!

00:07:37.620 --> 00:07:39.790
Look at all the silk!

00:07:40.220 --> 00:07:44.660
I can smell the sweet fragrance of corn!

00:07:44.660 --> 00:07:47.100
Okay, we're gonna keep digging it out, Terry!

00:07:48.230 --> 00:07:50.630
Knife-knife-knife-knife-knife!

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:53.800
Knife-knife-knife-knife-knife-knife-knife!

00:07:53.800 --> 00:07:55.570
Knife!

00:08:11.590 --> 00:08:13.090
There it is!

00:08:13.090 --> 00:08:14.990
BB Corn!

00:08:17.190 --> 00:08:20.300
Incredible! What size!

00:08:20.300 --> 00:08:21.300
Okay!

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:27.070
D-Damn, it won't budge.

00:08:27.070 --> 00:08:31.870
And I can't risk hurting the 
kernel with Knife or Fork...

00:08:32.770 --> 00:08:33.840
What?

00:08:33.840 --> 00:08:35.840
Don't feel down, Terry.

00:08:35.840 --> 00:08:37.280
Don't worry, okay?

00:08:37.280 --> 00:08:40.250
This is a chance for you to eat.

00:08:40.510 --> 00:08:43.380
I'll take the BB Corn, no matter what!

00:08:47.220 --> 00:08:50.890
I'll attack the other side 
and pop off the kernels!

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:54.730
I give thanks to this BB Corn,

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:59.200
and to all the living things 
in the forest for this bounty.

00:08:59.200 --> 00:09:00.800
Let's eat!

00:09:08.070 --> 00:09:10.680
5-Fold Spiked Punch!

00:09:35.000 --> 00:09:36.940
Great, we did it, Terry!

00:09:36.940 --> 00:09:38.840
We got the BB Corn!

00:09:38.840 --> 00:09:42.710
Anyway, BB Corn sure is incredible.

00:09:42.710 --> 00:09:45.740
There's even more kernels underneath those!

00:09:45.740 --> 00:09:48.910
There really are as many 
kernels as there are silks.

00:09:50.880 --> 00:09:52.280
What, Terry?

00:09:52.280 --> 00:09:55.150
You wanna make those into 
popcorn to eat already?

00:09:55.750 --> 00:09:57.020
I hear ya!

00:09:57.460 --> 00:10:03.060
But to pop a BB Corn that size 
we'll need some seriously hot fire.

00:10:03.230 --> 00:10:06.060
And that can mean only one place.

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:09.770
The Wool Volcano is near the 
southwest of the jungle.

00:10:09.770 --> 00:10:11.270
Let's head straight there!

00:10:12.540 --> 00:10:13.800
All right!

00:10:28.550 --> 00:10:30.590
T-That's...

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:40.100
That's strange...

00:10:40.100 --> 00:10:44.200
Did the forest go on in this direction?

00:10:52.040 --> 00:10:54.080
The trees are growing!

00:10:54.080 --> 00:10:57.450
Does this forest expand 
so incredibly quickly?

00:10:57.450 --> 00:11:01.580
Shoot... How am I supposed 
to find my way back?

00:11:03.850 --> 00:11:05.090
Hey, Terry!

00:11:06.360 --> 00:11:07.820
You know the way?

00:11:09.890 --> 00:11:12.490
Oh yeah, you marked the territory!

00:11:12.490 --> 00:11:13.460
All right!

00:11:13.460 --> 00:11:15.760
Great work there, Terry!

00:11:15.760 --> 00:11:18.400
That's some useful peeing!

00:11:22.270 --> 00:11:24.010
W-What's this?!

00:11:24.010 --> 00:11:25.840
The plants in the forest are...

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:33.210
A petal...

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:34.150
What?!

00:11:34.150 --> 00:11:36.480
Something with a Capture Level 5 is coming.

00:11:44.790 --> 00:11:46.190
Hey, do something!

00:11:46.190 --> 00:11:47.760
Aren't you a Gourmet Hunter, Zamboni?!

00:11:47.760 --> 00:11:50.800
No! My name is Zombie!

00:11:50.800 --> 00:11:53.270
Er, I mean Zonge!

00:11:53.270 --> 00:11:56.100
I beat up so many things 
in the forest today, so...

00:11:56.100 --> 00:11:59.570
If I do any more, my heart will ache!

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:02.140
Is this really the time for tall tales?

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:03.740
Huh?

00:12:04.440 --> 00:12:06.450
Was it scared off by me?

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:12.990
Aloefrillnecked Lizard (Plant 
Beast) Capture Level 10

00:12:22.630 --> 00:12:23.660
Komatsu-kun!

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:26.930
I'm pretty sure I saw it around here...

00:12:38.910 --> 00:12:40.310
This is...

00:12:43.920 --> 00:12:46.090
...a Woolstar Sauce tree!

00:12:46.090 --> 00:12:47.850
The fruits are still small, but...

00:12:47.850 --> 00:12:48.950
Komatsu-kun!

00:12:49.590 --> 00:12:50.990
There you are.

00:12:50.990 --> 00:12:52.190
What do you think you're doing?

00:12:52.190 --> 00:12:53.630
We have to hurry and run!

00:12:53.630 --> 00:12:54.990
I can't yet!

00:12:55.790 --> 00:12:58.360
The fruits aren't fully grown yet!

00:12:58.360 --> 00:13:00.000
Woolstar Sauce fruits?

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.470
But now isn't the time to be...

00:13:04.140 --> 00:13:08.270
I can't run away without getting these!

00:13:08.870 --> 00:13:10.110
Komatsu-kun!

00:13:10.810 --> 00:13:14.310
As a chef, I'm prepared for the consequences!

00:13:21.250 --> 00:13:22.050
Okay!

00:13:31.630 --> 00:13:32.530
Komatsu-kun!

00:13:38.340 --> 00:13:39.540
Komatsu-kun!

00:13:54.050 --> 00:13:55.250
Komatsu-kun!

00:13:59.220 --> 00:14:00.860
Oh yeah, back then...

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:03.660
Failures will save you.

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:05.460
I'm sure that will come in handy.

00:14:05.460 --> 00:14:07.160
Failures, huh?

00:14:07.160 --> 00:14:08.030
Right!

00:14:09.630 --> 00:14:12.500
Special Delicious Hot Spice!

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:21.140
Komatsu-kun!

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:29.350
Looks like I've kept you waiting, everyone.

00:14:29.850 --> 00:14:33.990
It seems like you've had a 
rough time, but worry not!

00:14:33.990 --> 00:14:35.160
Now that I'm here, there is...

00:14:35.160 --> 00:14:36.760
Komatsu-kun, are you okay?

00:14:37.030 --> 00:14:38.160
Yeah...

00:14:38.160 --> 00:14:40.530
The spice from before was pretty helpful.

00:14:40.530 --> 00:14:42.330
That's amazing! I'm impressed!

00:14:42.930 --> 00:14:45.270
It's all thanks to Coco-san.

00:14:45.800 --> 00:14:48.140
So much for my beautiful entrance!

00:14:48.140 --> 00:14:50.640
Oh... Sunny-san?

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:52.940
What are you doing here?

00:14:53.840 --> 00:14:55.110
Oh, that!

00:14:55.110 --> 00:14:56.610
I came to get that.

00:14:56.610 --> 00:14:59.580
Isn't that the aloe from the lizard before?

00:14:59.950 --> 00:15:03.020
This aloe is one heck of a moisturizer.

00:15:03.020 --> 00:15:05.650
It's incredibly great for skin and cuticles.

00:15:05.650 --> 00:15:06.950
Komatsu!

00:15:09.020 --> 00:15:10.930
Toriko-san!

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.660
You all came, too?

00:15:12.660 --> 00:15:13.090
Yes!

00:15:13.090 --> 00:15:15.760
What's with the big difference in reaction?

00:15:15.760 --> 00:15:18.530
I came to get a Woolstar Sauce fruit!

00:15:18.530 --> 00:15:19.730
Oh!

00:15:19.730 --> 00:15:23.040
Is that the BB Corn that Tom-san mentioned?

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:23.800
Yup!

00:15:23.800 --> 00:15:26.740
I'm heading to turn these into popcorn.

00:15:26.740 --> 00:15:30.440
Oh? The popcorn said to be the 
snack of Gourmet Royalty...

00:15:30.440 --> 00:15:31.950
You coming, too?

00:15:34.610 --> 00:15:36.180
I'm okay.

00:15:36.520 --> 00:15:37.680
Why?!

00:15:38.050 --> 00:15:42.590
I'd like to see the popcorn, 
but I have something to do.

00:15:44.920 --> 00:15:46.190
Understood.

00:15:47.990 --> 00:15:52.330
Aww... There's hardly ever a chance 
to see popcorn made from BB Corn...

00:15:52.330 --> 00:15:54.830
But it's my job to return to the IGO

00:15:54.830 --> 00:16:00.470
and use this to perfect a sauce 
to match the Bubbly Tuna!

00:16:00.470 --> 00:16:02.140
A man with a purpose...

00:16:03.640 --> 00:16:04.740
Okay!

00:16:04.740 --> 00:16:08.680
I also want to eat that Bubbly 
Tuna with a beautiful sauce!

00:16:08.680 --> 00:16:11.420
We'll head right back by my gorgeous flying!

00:16:14.050 --> 00:16:17.190
But you can't eat it, Sunny!

00:16:17.190 --> 00:16:18.420
Why not?

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:20.860
Better me than the summit, anyway.

00:16:20.860 --> 00:16:25.060
Give me a break, please!

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:28.230
Okay!

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:30.440
We've reached the cooking spot!

00:16:35.270 --> 00:16:38.440
I almost got cooked myself there!

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:42.250
Wool Volcano is known as a magma spot...

00:16:42.250 --> 00:16:44.320
The temperature of the 
magma that flows beneath it

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:49.350
50 °C

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:49.350
80 °C

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:49.350
100 °C

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:49.350
300 °C

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:49.350
500 °C

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:49.350
800 °C

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:49.350
1000 °C

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:49.350
1200 °C

00:16:42.450 --> 00:16:49.350
1400 °C

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:46.250
is no less than 1400 degrees...

00:16:46.250 --> 00:16:49.390
The temperature lowers the 
higher you are above it.

00:16:49.390 --> 00:16:53.460
But with this heat, I bet we can 
make some super yummy popcorn!

00:16:53.460 --> 00:16:56.590
Okay, time to cook some BB Corn!

00:16:59.800 --> 00:17:03.170
Heat it too fast and it'll burn.

00:17:03.170 --> 00:17:06.340
First we'll slowly heat it 
up to a low temperature.

00:17:06.570 --> 00:17:09.640
Okay, that should be enough...

00:17:09.640 --> 00:17:11.540
Oops, it's burning!

00:17:11.540 --> 00:17:13.680
I must have been too late!

00:17:13.680 --> 00:17:16.610
I can't let my eyes off it for a second...

00:17:27.360 --> 00:17:30.490
Here. You need to keep your fluids up.

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:32.290
This is gonna be a marathon.

00:17:32.700 --> 00:17:37.130
But I can't go on a rock any hotter...

00:17:38.970 --> 00:17:41.400
That's the hide of a Magma Rat!

00:17:41.400 --> 00:17:44.670
That hide can withstand 
extreme temperatures...

00:17:46.070 --> 00:17:48.340
I'll be using you, if you don't mind.

00:17:58.250 --> 00:17:59.950
Endure it, Terry.

00:17:59.950 --> 00:18:01.560
Show me some guts!

00:18:01.560 --> 00:18:04.760
Getting delicious food isn't so simple!

00:18:04.990 --> 00:18:11.170
The Capture Level of popcorn made 
from BB Corn might be over 30,

00:18:11.170 --> 00:18:13.170
but getting the ingredient is no easy feat.

00:18:15.340 --> 00:18:17.540
So, we're finally here...

00:18:22.840 --> 00:18:25.880
The lowest stone is the hottest.

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:27.680
1200 degrees!

00:18:27.680 --> 00:18:30.820
Now pop, BB Corn!

00:18:31.920 --> 00:18:32.890
It's about to!

00:18:33.350 --> 00:18:34.390
Come on!

00:18:34.720 --> 00:18:35.990
Come on!

00:18:35.990 --> 00:18:37.420
Come on!

00:18:39.860 --> 00:18:41.760
There we go!

00:18:52.070 --> 00:18:53.410
We did it!

00:18:53.410 --> 00:18:55.540
It's raining popcorn!

00:18:55.540 --> 00:18:57.010
We did it, Terry!

00:18:57.010 --> 00:19:00.080
You did great getting through 
it, not even showing any strain!

00:19:01.410 --> 00:19:04.350
Eating after a hard struggle 
just ups the bar even more!

00:19:04.350 --> 00:19:07.120
Now, let's eat!

00:19:08.750 --> 00:19:11.290
What incredible size!

00:19:11.290 --> 00:19:13.990
It's more like cotton candy than popcorn.

00:19:13.990 --> 00:19:17.300
And this amount... It's way 
more than 100 servings.

00:19:17.860 --> 00:19:19.330
And the smell...

00:19:19.330 --> 00:19:21.430
Like a croquette fresh out of the fryer.

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:27.070
I give thanks for all the 
great bounty in this world...

00:19:27.070 --> 00:19:28.440
Let's eat.

00:19:31.040 --> 00:19:32.380
Terry, how is it?

00:19:41.390 --> 00:19:42.650
Delicious?

00:19:42.950 --> 00:19:44.260
It is?

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:48.560
Good for you, Terry!

00:19:48.560 --> 00:19:50.660
Okay, I'm going to eat it, too!

00:19:54.670 --> 00:19:55.730
Delicious!

00:19:55.730 --> 00:19:58.340
It's so delicious, I can't stop my hands!

00:19:58.340 --> 00:20:00.910
I feel like I could keep 
on eating them forever!

00:20:00.910 --> 00:20:02.870
Chew! Taste!

00:20:04.210 --> 00:20:06.210
Yum!

00:20:06.210 --> 00:20:09.450
Each bite makes the flavor grow and deepen!

00:20:09.450 --> 00:20:12.780
The fluffy texture goes 
down my throat with ease!

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:16.250
And most of all, each one 
I eat makes me want more!

00:20:16.250 --> 00:20:18.560
It's like I'm getting hungrier and hungrier!

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:20.290
I want to eat other food, too!

00:20:20.290 --> 00:20:24.290
These things whet an 
appetite like none other!

00:20:24.690 --> 00:20:27.960
Wouldn't... this be perfect?!

00:20:27.960 --> 00:20:29.530
For that slot...

00:20:31.070 --> 00:20:32.900
Oh, perfect timing!

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:35.040
The volcanic ash of the Wool Volcano

00:20:35.040 --> 00:20:37.740
has a great salt content... 
You can even eat it!

00:20:37.740 --> 00:20:40.410
An ideal spice for the popcorn!

00:20:40.710 --> 00:20:44.480
It looks like the Wool Volcano 
is giving us its blessing, Terry!

00:20:44.480 --> 00:20:49.180
I've found food that suits your palate, 
and decided on my Hors d'oeuvre!

00:20:49.890 --> 00:20:56.360
The Hors d'oeuvre on my Full 
Course Menu will be BB Corn!

00:20:56.630 --> 00:20:58.790
Hors d'oeuvre BB Corn 
(Grain) Capture Level 30

00:20:58.790 --> 00:21:01.360
This will be perfect to start things off.

00:21:01.360 --> 00:21:04.000
It will make all the other dishes 
in the course taste even better!

00:21:04.430 --> 00:21:07.770
Thanks, Terry! It's all because of you!

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:16.740
BB Corn, delicious!

00:21:16.740 --> 00:21:19.810
Can I suck up that dog, too?

00:21:44.440 --> 00:21:50.110
Is the night wind, caressing my cheek

00:21:50.640 --> 00:21:56.380
proof the world is spinning, I wonder?

00:21:57.120 --> 00:22:03.620
Each time I move out, the 
direction of the wind changes.

00:22:04.020 --> 00:22:08.560
Maybe that’s telling me something.

00:22:09.830 --> 00:22:13.670
I was searching for what happiness meant.

00:22:13.670 --> 00:22:17.040
Aiming for the island in my dreams,

00:22:17.040 --> 00:22:21.510
on a journey with no end!

00:22:23.340 --> 00:22:26.480
Blown by the winds of tomorrow,

00:22:26.480 --> 00:22:29.620
drifting off to who-knows-where,

00:22:29.620 --> 00:22:35.620
amid the waves of time.

00:22:38.660 --> 00:22:40.860
Gourmet News!

00:22:41.690 --> 00:22:43.360
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:43.360 --> 00:22:46.930
BB Corn, said to be the 
snacks of Gourmet Royalty!

00:22:46.670 --> 00:22:49.970
BB Corn (Grain) Capture Level 30

00:22:46.930 --> 00:22:50.240
Its full name is Blue Blood Corn.

00:22:50.240 --> 00:22:52.340
It has an ability to whet the appetite,

00:22:52.340 --> 00:22:54.540
and it's really easy to eat too many of them!

00:22:54.540 --> 00:22:55.670
Delicious!

00:22:55.670 --> 00:22:56.840
Seconds, please!

00:22:56.840 --> 00:23:02.310
"Apologies, but we've run out 
of corn... and corny jokes."

00:23:03.180 --> 00:23:05.080
Now, on to the next story...

00:23:07.050 --> 00:23:09.250
Toriko faces a fearsome new foe!

00:23:09.250 --> 00:23:11.790
Actually, this guy seems like a real weirdo!

00:23:12.870 --> 00:23:16.230
The Gourmet Corp. Assassin! 
The Moment Toriko's Techniques Evolve!

00:23:16.480 --> 00:23:18.480
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
